  (e) Any illegal use of the Software
  (f) Failure to pay licensing fees
  (g) Breach of any provision of this Agreement

9.2 Effect of Termination
------------------------
Upon termination, the Licensee shall:

  (a) Cease all use of the Software immediately
  (b) Delete all copies of the Software in possession
  (c) Return all proprietary materials to the Licensor
